              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-8__amdact-8__item-6">
                <num>34</num>
                <heading>Paragraph 54(1)(c)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Before “any of”, insert “the GEMS Regulator is satisfied that”.</p>
